# Agent guardrails

Read `AGENTS.md` before non-trivial changes.

## Required verification

```bash
npm run validate        # after most code changes
npm run test:e2e        # after pages, routing, layout, or resume changes
```

## Do not

- Weaken `vitest.config.ts` coverage thresholds to make CI pass
- Commit `dist/`, `coverage/`, `test-results/`, or scratch resume HTML
- Remove **GodSphere** from Aether Lab (`src/components/canvas/GodSphere.tsx`, `AnomalyMatrix.tsx`)
- Use `--no-verify` unless you understand what hooks skipped

## Prefer

- Small, focused diffs — one fix or feature per commit
- Match surrounding code style (Prettier + ESLint already configured)
- Route path for algorithms page is `/algorithm` (singular), not `/algorithms`
